<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Auto mining macro</Major>
    <Description>Easy to use macro, mines every 21 secs (time it takes to mine a rock), because of the animation bug you walk back after every mine so this script also walks forward a bit after 3 mines,</Description>
    <Comment>https://botmek.com - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 8 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 8 1
Delay 21 s
KeyDown 8 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 8 1
Delay 21 s
KeyDown 8 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 8 1
Delay 21 s
KeyDown 26 1
Delay 64 ms
KeyUp 26 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 26 1
Delay 64 ms
KeyUp 26 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 26 1
Delay 64 ms
KeyUp 26 1
Delay 64
GoWhile 1 47</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>GTA 5 RP</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>